{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2013/06/22/0900664/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいまい(〃ω〃)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいまい。まいまいまいぺーすまいまい\n好きよー♪んふふ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"右になんかスペースが。\nんでも気にしない。まいぺーす"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめぺーす！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ごめんなさい何でもないですーるーん♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"告知ばーん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2013/06/22/0900664/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"文化放送「スパカン！」\n日時：2013年6月28日\n番組放送時間：21：30〜24：00\n番組HP: http://www.joqr.co.jp/supacan/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生田絵梨花、川後陽菜、中元日芽香"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お楽しみに(^O^)☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えーなんだろな"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日久々にメイクしてレッスン行ったら\nいくちゃんが褒めてくれましたー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっそうそう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あのね、みなさん\n風船は膨らませることできますかー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...えっとね ばかにしてるわけじゃないの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お腹を使って歌をうたう人は\n風船が膨らませられるらしいんだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんは全くだめだった(´・ω・｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なにゆえ..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂のメンバーとして、\n元放送部部長として\nもうこれは全力で恥じましたー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃああたしは今まで\nどっから声出してたんだろう..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":".........。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...ごほっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前の\n146コメさんがみくもてぃだったの(*^ω^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さっすが姉さんもってんなー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"手書きメッセージ書くから待っててね☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2013/06/22/0900664/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2013/06/22/0900664/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんのことも好きなんだけど\n万理華のことも大好きなんです!!\n俺はどーしたら良いでしょうか。\nそんなあなたの前には\n３つのコマンドが点滅してる。はず\n▽万理華推しになる\n▽日芽香推しになる\n▽なかいさん推しになる\nうまーれーかーわるのはーきーみだ〜♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2013/06/22/0900664/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆりんごとひめたんの\n2ショット写真見たいです><\nそーいや撮ったよ最近！\n近々貼るねー( ω )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2013/06/22/0900664/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんちゃんさんは\n柏幸奈ちゃんさんと仲良しだったんですね!?\n詰め込んだね(笑)えっとー質問なんだっけか\nあーそうそう仲良しですよー♪\nゆっきーなーーあああ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2013/06/22/0900664/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"君の名は希望の個人PV\n誰のがお気に入りですか？\n万理華の！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2013/06/22/0900664/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんは女子アナになりました。\n誰にどんなインタビューしたいですか？\nジャッキーちゃんの特番を作るべく\nいろんなこと聞いてみたいですね(ω)\n11人お兄さんいらっしゃいますが\n誰が一番好きですかーとかね。\n大きなバケツプリンは好きですかーとか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2013/06/22/0900664/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてー\nまた質問募集しますー( ^ω^ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日の24時あたりで締め切ります！\nどしどし聞いてね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2013/06/22/0900664/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2013/06/22/0900664/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2013/06/22/0900664/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回の写めのおまけ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これくらいとってみた。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(＊´・ω・＊)"}],"source":"archive"}